- ((s−1+33) mod 81)+1 = **((s+32) mod 81)+1**

Note that one survivor is always s itself — the starting position always survives, which makes sense since position 1 in the relabeled system always survives.

**Solving for the higher survivor = 40.** We need max(s, ((s+32) mod 81)+1) = 40.

- If s = 40: the other survivor is ((40+32) mod 81)+1 = 73, so max = 73 ≠ 40. ✗
